---
title: "C19 — Status change to activity and invalidation · Implemented"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Client A
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant P as Worker dispatcher
  participant Q as BullMQ
  participant W as Worker consumer
  participant G as Socket gateway
  participant B as Client B
  U->>A: Change task status
  A->>D: Commit task, version and outbox together
  A-->>U: Authoritative response
  P->>D: Claim committed outbox event
  D-->>P: Persisted event reference and lease
  P->>Q: Enqueue stable event-ID reference
  P->>D: Mark queued with recovery recheck
  Q->>W: Deliver job, possibly repeatedly
  W->>D: Reload event and persist activity idempotently
  W->>G: Publish through private Redis channel
  W->>D: Mark delivered after publication
  G->>G: Recheck each recipient
  G-->>B: Content-free invalidation
  B->>A: Refetch authorized data
